      "claim": "L6 hepatic clearance records show related morphinans/opioids undergo relevant first-pass metabolic clearance: dextromethorphan O-demethylation in human liver microsomes (CLint2 0.21-0.52 ml/h/mg) and rat microsomal CLint 70-83 µL/min/mL; dihydrocodeine CYP2D6 CLint 0.19 µL/min/pmol; morphine UGT2B7 glucuronidation CLint 11 nL/min/unit.",
